 "remarks": "Located at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac just steps from Cummings Park, this meticulously maintained and fully renovated 2/3 family Colonial offers generous living space, exceptional versatility, and outstanding amenities. Currently configured as a two-family home, this unique property spans three floors and offers exceptional flexibility: whether for use as a two-family rental, an owner-occupied residence with rental income, or for multi-generational living. The first floor features two bedrooms, a living room with a fireplace, an updated kitchen, formal dining room, and full bath. The second floor boasts an open-concept layout, with a well-appointed kitchen featuring a wine fridge and custom-built breakfast bar that seamlessly connects to the family room, complete with an electric fireplace. The luxurious and spacious primary suite offers an oversized walk-in closet, and a spa-inspired marble bath complete with a soaking tub and separate rainfall shower. A laundry area, half bath, and private deck complete the second floor. The third floor features two additional bedrooms, a full bath, and a kitchen and living area. In the private backyard is a built-in grill, outdoor fireplace, koi pond, and expansive patio. A custom-built detached office provides a private workspace separate from the main living areas. Conveniently located - minutes from beaches, Chelsea Piers, downtown, Metro-North, & I-95, this exceptional home offers the perfect balance of comfort and coastal living!",
